codex
Research is converging on three material domains: Ionis’ single-strand ASO chemistry, GalNAc/LICA delivery for liver targets, and the commercial/manufacturing system around TRYNGOLZA, DAWNZERA, WAINUA, SPINRAZA, and QALSODY. For the frontend, I’ll use a restrained Desert Rose dashboard: stacked score layers as the core workspace, compact evidence sections below, and small scroll/hover transitions rather than a marketing-style page.
codex
I’m going to add a run-specific builder script now. It will write only `payload.json`, then read the scorer-produced `scored.json` to create the self-contained dashboard so the numeric and prose rendering stays routed through the approved scoring step.
apply patch
